<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<ruleset name="Java 共通規範" xmlns="http://pmd.sourceforge.net/ruleset/2.0.0"
         xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
         xsi:schemaLocation="http://pmd.sourceforge.net/ruleset/2.0.0 https://pmd.sourceforge.io/ruleset_2_0_0.xsd">
  <description>依 tools/java/rule-map.yml 建立；候選規則不在預設集合。</description>
  <!-- JV-ER-028 -->
  <rule name="ResourceCapturedByAsyncTask" language="java" class="net.sourceforge.pmd.lang.rule.xpath.XPathRule" message="[JV-ER-028] 有效期與關閉契約 → rules/stacks/java/common/exceptions-and-resources.md#java-resource-close-contract" externalInfoUrl="https://github.com/clarkeforwork-coder/dev-rule/blob/main/rules/stacks/java/common/exceptions-and-resources.md#java-resource-close-contract">
    <description>規範違反範例 CompletableFuture.runAsync(lambda 使用 input, executor) 被報；；誤報風險說明：在 try 內同步等待結果的 executor.submit(() -&gt; input.read()).get() 也會被報（samples/SubClauses.java:61 實測報）；此類需抑制；Java 21 符合範例（ExecutorService 本身是資源、lambda 不引用它）不報；；實證版本：17。</description>
    <priority>1</priority>
    <properties>
      <property name="xpath"><value><![CDATA[//TryStatement[@TryWithResources = true()]/Block//MethodCall[@MethodName=('runAsync','supplyAsync','submit','execute','schedule','scheduleAtFixedRate','scheduleWithFixedDelay','invokeAll','invokeAny','thenRunAsync','thenApplyAsync','thenAcceptAsync','thenComposeAsync','whenCompleteAsync','handleAsync','start')]/ArgumentList/*[self::LambdaExpression or self::MethodReference][descendant-or-self::*[self::VariableAccess or self::MethodReference]/@Name = ancestor::TryStatement[@TryWithResources = true()][1]/ResourceList/Resource//VariableId/@Name]]]></value></property>
    </properties>
  </rule>
</ruleset>
